        <div type="bibliography">
           <p>This stone was probably one of the inscribed stone at Pasru Jambe reported by Sukarto K. Atmodjo (<bibl rend="omitname"><ptr target="bib:SukartoAtmodjo1986_01"/></bibl>), since there are two inscribed stones that containing same text as dechipered above. Later this inscribed stone also deciphered by the Archaeological Service by Titi Surti Nastiti et al. (<bibl rend="omitname"><ptr target="bib:TitiSurtiNastiti+al1994-1995_01"/></bibl>), Machi Suhadi &amp; Richadiana Kartakusuma (<bibl rend="omitname"><ptr target="bib:MachiSuhadi+RichadianaKartakusuma1996_01"/></bibl>) and Budi Santosa Wibowo (<bibl rend="omitname"><ptr target="bib:BudiSantosaWibowo2001_01"/></bibl>). This digital edition based on photographs (2011).</p>

